 "text": "The thirty-minute protein window? Mostly a myth. Max sprints to his shake after every workout… for nothing. When studies controlled for total daily protein, workout timing barely mattered. How much? About point-seven grams per pound a day. Past that, gains level off. And split it up. Four protein meals beat two huge ones or eight snacks for the muscle-building response. So relax. Hit your number, spread it out… and walk to your shake.",
